This becomes obvious if we identify $L' \otimes _ R M$ and $L \otimes _ R M$ with submodules of $M^{\oplus n}$ (which is legitimate since the maps $L \otimes _ R M \to M^{\oplus n}$ and $L' \otimes _ R M \to M^{\oplus n}$ are injective and commute with the obvious map $L' \otimes _ R M \to L \otimes _ R M$).